@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC18 Kham pha va tim kiem POI cong khai

actor "Khach tham quan" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebPublicUI - HomePage, PoisPage, SearchPage va PoiDetailPage" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nPublicPoisController + PublicPoiService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nPoiRepository + PoiTranslationRepository + MediaRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo danh sach, tim kiem hoac chi tiet POI
Actor -> UI: Chon ngon ngu, danh muc hoac nhap tu khoa
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau public POI
Business -> DataAccess: Doc POI theo bo loc
DataAccess -> Database: Doc Poi va PoiTranslation
Database --> DataAccess: Tra du lieu POI
DataAccess --> Business: Tra cac POI ung vien
Business -> Business: Loc active, lifecycle, xoa mem va thoi han
Business -> DataAccess: Doc anh Approved cua cac POI hop le
DataAccess -> Database: Doc MediaFile
Database --> DataAccess: Tra anh
DataAccess --> Business: Tra anh hop le
alt Co POI cong khai
  Business -> Business: Chon ban dich yeu cau hoac fallback
  Business --> UI: Tra danh sach hoac chi tiet
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi POI va lien ket ban do/goi nghe
else Khong co ket qua hoac POI khong con public
  Business --> UI: Tra danh sach rong hoac khong tim thay
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi trang thai khong co du lieu
end
@enduml
